ent-CMUAutocompressor = CPR compressor
    .desc = A battery-powered chest compressor that maintains CPR on an unconscious human. Requires medical training to fit and a clear outer-clothing slot. Supports resuscitation; does not replace a defibrillator or treatment of injuries.
cmu-autocompressor-ribs-fractured = The CPR compressor fractures { $target }'s ribs!
cmu-autocompressor-ribs-compound = Continued compressions severely worsen { $target }'s rib fractures!
cmu-autocompressor-ribs-shattered = The CPR compressor shatters { $target }'s ribs!
cmu-autocompressor-deploy-dummy = Deploy the CPR dummy before fitting the compressor.
cmu-autocompressor-dummy-occupied = A CPR compressor is already fitted to this dummy.
